#: Youtube_settings.py:308
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user.\n"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີເອົາຄຸກກີ້ YouTube:\n"
"\n"
"1. ຕິດຕັ້ງສ່ວນເສີມ 'Get cookies.txt' ໃນ Chrome ຫຼື Firefox\n"
"2. ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບ YouTube ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ\n"
"3. ກົດທີ່ໄອຄອນສ່ວນເສີມແລ້ວເລືອກ export cookies\n"
"4. ບັນທຶກເປັນ cookies.txt ແລ້ວມາເລືອກຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້\n"
"\n"
"ການໃຊ້ຄຸກກີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການຖືກບລັອກ ເພາະ YouTube ຈະເຫັນວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແລ້ວ.\n"

